  "label": "Pancreatic Cancer",
  "description": "A serious and often fatal form of cancer that affects the pancreas. It is known for being difficult to detect early and having a low survival rate. The mention of pancreatic cancer in the meme is a real-world medical condition that is used here as a punchline to imply that the speaker is so angry or frustrated that they are willing to use violent language (telling the doctor to 'shut his commie mouth') even in the face of a serious illness. This is a form of dark humor or irony.",
